{
  "nl": "部门员工表（自定义列顺序）：按部门、小组、姓名、月薪四列展示，部门列按相邻相同合并。支持新增、编辑。",
  "nlEn": "Department staff table (custom column order): shows department, team, name and salary; the department column merges across adjacent equal values. Supports add and edit.",
  "fixedFields": [
    "dept",
    "team",
    "name",
    "salary"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "membership",
    "actions",
    "mergeConfig"
  ],
  "config": {
    "name": "DeptExplicitCols",
    "apiUrl": "/api/staff",
    "target": "vue3",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "dept",
        "label": "部门",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "team",
        "label": "小组",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "name",
        "label": "姓名",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "salary",
        "label": "月薪",
        "formtype": "InputNumber"
      }
    ],
    "columns": [
      {
        "prop": "dept",
        "label": "部门"
      },
      {
        "prop": "team",
        "label": "小组"
      },
      {
        "prop": "name",
        "label": "姓名"
      },
      {
        "prop": "salary",
        "label": "月薪"
      }
    ],
    "mergeConfig": {
      "rowsBy": [
        "dept"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "AI-23: mergeConfig 与显式 columns 逃生数组共存（合并与列定义正交，互不干扰）。AN-08 移除了列级 formatter 字符串：JSON 配置承载不了函数，运行时列适配器会 `formatter(...)` 直接调用 → 字符串会在渲染时抛 not a function；列级自定义格式化属于源码扩展点，不在配置契约内"
}
